==German==

===Etymology===
From {{inh|de|gmh|lahs}}, from {{inh|de|goh|lahs}}, from {{inh|de|gmw-pro|*lahs}}, from {{inh|de|gem-pro|*lahsaz}}.{{dercat|de|ine-pro}}

